Upon the applicant’s request, the Constitutional Court referred the case to the Administrative Court by a decision of 29 July 2005.

The applicant made submissions on 5 September 2005 to supplement his complaint to the Administrative Court.

The Independent Administrative Panel submitted its observations in reply on 10 October 2005.

